{
  "_comment": [
    "Hex Bolt and Blight Burst nodes in the Weapon Skills tab of Skill Tree (RPG Series): one fixed node and a choice of two, like the",
    "staves of the other schools. Read on every load (/reload); data packs may replace this file.",
    "definitions: the three skill definitions (ids must not exist in the tab). nodes: node key -> definition; the node ids in the",
    "tab are blightcaller_weapon_blight_<key>. links: connections between the node keys.",
    "place: a free group of three cells of the honeycomb, pointing the same way as the groups of the roots in 'near' (within",
    "max_angle degrees), as close to them as possible; free = at least free_factor x the cell distance from every node.",
    "align_rows: groups whose root lies in the same group rows as those roots come first.",
    "near_peer: with Stormcaller, its Lightning Bolt group (placed after this one) counts as a reference group too; its cells are",
    "kept free either way, so neither group pushes the other away.",
    "mod_1 is placed left of the pointing direction, mod_2 right."
  ],
